        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Hn 90.11" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="606" ed="#liebermann"/>Sunt etiam infortuniorum genera quamplurima casu<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="3" target="#Hn_90-11.lnote.oe.3"/> magis quam consilio contingencia et misericordie<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="h" target="#Hn_90-11.lnote.oe.h"/> pocius quam iudicio committenda.</ab>
